   game=("Body Defence Tower", "Stack defence cards (skin, mucus, fever, white blood cells, vaccine) to build your tower. Each turn the opponent plays germ attack cards; a germ gets through if your tower lacks the right defence. Last tower standing wins."),
   exp=["Bread and hands: touch slices with unwashed, water-washed and soap-washed hands; seal each in a bag for a week (never open).", "Breathing rate before and after skipping for a minute."],
   act=["Learn a 5-pose yoga sequence.", "First-aid role play: a cut, a burn, a nosebleed."],
