   game=("Landform Survivor", "Draw a land card (Thar desert, Ladakh, Kerala coast, Gangetic plains). Build a home, food, clothing and transport set from your cards that fits that land. The opponent throws an event at you (sandstorm, snowfall, monsoon flood); survive it with the right card to score."),
